    {
      "text": "Lehi1 has reason to rejoice in the Lord because of Nephi1 and Sam, 1 Ne. 8:3. let your hearts rejoice, 2 Ne. 9:52. we rejoice in Christ, 2 Ne. 25:26. poor among men shall rejoice in the Holy One, 2 Ne. 27:30 (Isa. 29:19). Benjamin teaches his people to keep commandments that they might rejoice, Mosiah 2:4. because of great knowledge, people rejoice, Mosiah 5:4. Alma1 and Helam come forth out of water rejoicing, Mosiah 18:14. peace and rejoicing in Church for four years, Alma 46:38. Pahoran1 rejoices in greatness of heart of Moroni1, Alma 61:9. fathers have rejoiced in Christ’s day, Hel. 8:22. devil laughs and his angels rejoice because of slain, 3 Ne. 9:2.",
